locally. Nothing is fetched, bundled, vendored, or mirrored by this project.

ENFORCEMENT

This boundary is enforced mechanically, not merely by convention:

    .gitignore                   denies binary and archive patterns
    scripts/check-no-binaries.sh inspects the git index by filename,
                                 file size, and magic bytes
    .githooks/pre-commit         runs the above on every commit

Enable the hook after cloning:

    git config core.hooksPath .githooks

